  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You brag and demonstrate your most impressive wordplay. On a failed Will save, the target is impressed for 10 minutes and fascinated for as long as you continue to spend at least a move action to speak each turn. On a successful save, the target is impressed until the start of your next turn if it has fewer Hit Dice than the number of ranks in the associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
